Obtained from the Lichess source repository (lichess-org/lila) and converted
from the original .ogg/.mp3 files to mono PCM .wav (22050 Hz), renamed to
scidCommunity's move-sound names:

    Move       -> move, move_normal, move_castling, move_promotion
    Capture    -> move_capture
    Check      -> move_check, Check
    Checkmate  -> Mate

